Subject: [PATCH] Osmium: simplify OsmiumChunkProcessor constructor call


diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/Level.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/Level.java
index 4fa6f58a1d5bd4ed1283313fa13bd0a4b0530637..f890978bc1b7bb3aa688a855cc6fb6fad42392d2 100644
